TY  - JOUR
TI  - Recovery of neodymium and dysprosium from waste NdFeB magnets by sulfation roasting and water leaching
AB  - Waste NdFeB magnets were treated by sulfation roasting followed by water leaching to recover Nd and Dy. Leaching efficiencies of 98% for Nd and 95% for Dy were achieved, with separation factor beta(Nd/Dy) of 12. The process provides a closed-loop route for rare earth recycling from end-of-life magnets.
AU  - Zhang, Wei
PY  - 2023
