TY  - JOUR
TI  - Hydrogen decrepitation of sintered Nd-Fe-B magnets for direct reuse of magnet powders
AB  - Hydrogen decrepitation (HD) was applied to scrap sintered NdFeB magnets. Coarse powder suitable for re-sintering was obtained, and recovered magnets showed 95% of original coercivity after grain boundary diffusion repair with Tb. Direct reuse avoided full dissolution of rare earth elements.
AU  - Li, Ming
PY  - 2022
