TI  - La-doped TiO2 photocatalyst for enhanced degradation of methylene blue under visible light
AB  - La-doped TiO2 nanoparticles were synthesized by sol-gel method. The 2 mol% La-doped sample showed the highest photocatalytic activity for methylene blue degradation under visible light, attributed to suppressed electron-hole recombination. Characterization included XRD, TEM and UV-vis DRS.
AU  - Chen, Lei
