TI  - Machine learning prediction of rare earth extraction equilibrium data: a DFT and neural network study
AB  - Density functional theory calculations and neural network models were developed to predict rare earth solvent extraction equilibria with P507. Model predictions agreed with literature data within 5%. No new experiments were conducted in this study; all data were compiled from published sources.
