TY  - JOUR
TI  - Adsorption recovery of yttrium and europium from waste phosphor powder leachate using biochar
AB  - Y and Eu were recovered from leachate of waste trichromatic phosphor powder using citric-acid-modified biochar. Maximum adsorption capacities of 152 mg/g (Y) and 138 mg/g (Eu) were measured in batch experiments. Desorption with 0.5 M HNO3 yielded a concentrated recoverate with 94% purity, enabling recycling of rare earths from lamp waste.
AU  - Sato, Yuki
