TI  - Review of hydrometallurgical routes for rare earth recovery from secondary resources
AB  - This review summarizes hydrometallurgical routes for rare earth recovery from waste magnets, phosphors, batteries and polishing waste published in the last decade. Challenges including impurity control and reagent regeneration are discussed. Over 150 studies are surveyed.
