TI  - Cerium oxide nanoparticles as abrasive polishing media: synthesis and polishing performance on glass substrates
AB  - CeO2 nanoparticles were synthesized by homogeneous precipitation and evaluated as chemical mechanical polishing (CMP) slurries for glass. Material removal rate increased with particle size. Waste polishing slurry management is briefly discussed in the conclusion section.
